<title>USA: Worcester, Mass., $36 mln bonds won by JP Morgan.</title>
<headline>Worcester, Mass., $36 mln bonds won by JP Morgan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>JP Morgan Securities said Thursday it won $36 million Worcester, Mass., limited tax bonds at a true interest cost of 5.16 percent.</p>
</text>
